
Inkqubo ulawulo-lwenkumbulo: 1.
Inkqubo inkumbulo: 16000000.
>> tokens := ['{}↲.:,x() '].
{ :i
	>> ikhowudi := [''].
	>> x := Inani phakathi: 1 kunye: 10.
	{
		>> y := Inani phakathi: 1 kunye: (tokens ubude).
		ikhowudi yongeza-ekugqibeleni: (tokens unobumba: y).
	} × x.
	{ Umsebenzi entsha: ikhowudi. } bamba: { ['Empty']. }, qala.

} × 10000.
Imveliso bhala: ['OK'], umgca-omtsha.
